logmerger
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

LogWeave's timestamp-format catalogue (see docs/SPEC.md section 4.1) is adopted
from `logmerger` by Paul McGuire:

    https://github.com/ptmcg/logmerger

The format patterns, their strptime equivalents, and the custom-format template
mechanism derive from that project's `timestamp_wrapper.py`. LogWeave's detection
*strategy* and its extraction implementation are original work (see SPEC 4.2-4.4),
but the catalogue of recognised formats is logmerger's contribution and is used
here under its MIT licence, reproduced below.

